OL,4,CNew EU-UK deal should reduce 'Irish    
OL,5,CSea border' impact                     
OL,6,GA new deal between the UK and the EU   
OL,7,Gon food, plants and animals is likely  
OL,8,Gto be significant for Northern Ireland 
OL,9,Gby reducing the impact of the "Irish   
OL,10,GSea border".                           
OL,12,FThe agreement is expected to be        
OL,13,Fconfirmed later when Prime Minister    
OL,14,FAndy Burnham meets European Commission 
OL,15,FPresident Ursula von der Leyen in      
OL,16,FBrussels.                              
OL,18,FSince Brexit, Northern Ireland has     
OL,19,Fcontinued to follow EU rules for agri- 
OL,20,Ffood products while the rest of the UK 
OL,21,Fhas not.                               
